# Bottom power button (LiFePO4wered/Pi+): holding it shuts the system down.
# tapboxd sees that as SIGTERM, i.e. `power off`: it must save before power goes.
tap story-440
wait 42s
power off
expect cmd pause
expect cmd persist
expect not cmd shutdown          # already shutting down; don't ask again
expect led shutting-down
expect position story-440 42s
